    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d132">

                <pb facs="0279" n="183" sameAs="frus:frus1872p1/pg183"/>

                <head>No. 132.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Washburne to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Paris</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-09-05"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 5, 1872</date>.
                        (Received September 19.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 679.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward you herewith a
                    copy of the correspondence between Mr. de Rémusat and myself, upon the subject
                    of the persecution of the Israelites in Moldo-Wallaehia, referred to in your
                    dispatch No. 430, of July 22.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. B. WASHBURNE.</signed>
                </closer>




                <xi:include href="d132-a1.xml" xpointer="d132-a1"/>
